    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d580">

                <pb facs="0697" n="612" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg612"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.6363/554: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Mexico</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Summerlin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-10-07T10:00:00-06:36"><hi rendition="#italic">October 7,
                                1919, 10 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received 9.55
                            p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>3213. Senate petroleum bill was defeated in the Senate yesterday by vote of 26 to
                    17. Senate will begin discussion of Executive petroleum bill<anchor n="96"
                        xml:id="d580-f1"/> today.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Summerlin</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
